  "Metadata": {
    "Summary": "Runtime two-bone IK with first-class pole vector control that works on any rigged model, zero setup.",
    "Description": "Better IK gives any skinned model working, stable two-bone IK (arms, legs) with a proper pole vector, computed analytically every frame. Drop the component on the end bone (hand/foot); it walks up the skeleton to find the chain automatically, works on Citizen or any custom rig, and layers on top of the animgraph instead of fighting it.\n\nSource & issues: https://github.com/zeljkovranjes/sbox-better-ik",
    "WebsiteUrl": "https://github.com/zeljkovranjes/sbox-better-ik"
  }
}
